{"id":"td-4153","category":"teardown","cover":"🔧","region":"global","publishedAt":"2026-08-29","tags":["拆解分析","大众"],"title":{"zh":"【车灯拆解2611】一汽大众迈腾 大灯","en":"","ko":""},"summary":{"zh":"今天，小编为大家带来现款一汽大众迈腾的高配大灯拆解。\n\n作为一汽大众的明星车型，今年迈腾虽然销量有所下滑，但在国产车的猛烈冲击下，还能保持月均过万的销量也真的非常不容易。话不多说，","en":"","ko":""},"body":{"zh":"今天，小编为大家带来现款一汽大众迈腾的高配大灯拆解。\n\n作为一汽大众的明星车型，今年迈腾虽然销量有所下滑，但在国产车的猛烈冲击下，还能保持月均过万的销量也真的非常不容易。话不多说，我们看灯。\n\n从功能上看，两颗模组组成远近光，反光碗角灯，加厚壁信号灯。我们先看信号灯这个半总成部分。\n\n白色底座支架，上侧黑色盖板，中间厚壁和两块pcba，这是经典的转向、位置、日行三合一设计。\n\n接下来来看照明功能部分。首先是角灯，这是德系车的标配。\n\n角灯设计很简单，反射碗加一个带散热器的pcba。这有一个小的设计，led的侧方有布置一个黑色的挡片，目的是让led不要直射到灯外，全部的灯光均打向反射碗。\n\n接下来看远近光透镜。首先两个透镜饰圈侧面都设计了发光部分，光学设计采用led侧向打到支架上的透明小厚壁，再通过饰圈上的散射透镜射出。能不能做信号灯功能小编不得而知，但是至少是个有辨识度的氛围灯。\n\n透镜A总成由壳体、透镜、分光片、散热器、pcba以及两个聚光器组成。pcba上有12颗led。\n\n透镜B总成由壳体、透镜、散热器、pcba和聚光器组成。pcba上除了有32颗led外，还有控制芯片。\n\n这板子上值得注意的是矩阵控制芯片。Global的供应商在该芯片首选一直是TI的TPS92662或者TPS92664，这是小编首次在大众系的车灯上发现国产矩阵芯片——CPSQ5462.\n\n经确认，这是一款来自易冲半导体的矩阵控制芯片，从量产灯具的情况看，这颗矩阵芯片已经被充分验证并实现了对进口产品的替代。\n\nCPSQ5462在Global车厂实现量产，证明了国产芯片的性能和成本越来越获得客户认可。后续小编也会更多关注这款产品在更多车厂端的量产表现。最后的惯例，这款灯来自海拉。","en":"","ko":""},"source":{"name":{"zh":"车灯研究院","en":"Headlight Institute","ko":"차灯연구원"},"type":"web","url":"https://www.dengdengschool.com/article/dengjuchaijie/4153.html","author":""},"media":{"images":["https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWHl0JJlicWH03llgLL7jYHJ4efMZiatdrFBfibboyPrib1uYI8Uh006O7w5WkdPmSIpToknBEZtOUU4s28BF0Tm52PRXg4OtQVicSD4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWFc4l9zYLf1oKtoNN0IyuOCZibM80IWYZCJc1liabOgPj3MyMectFDshfia6oY5qXlrv3HjzQm4icCnLLicx9zfVbF1rdRPKuZmJEVc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWFKDibkg60KC43BsWt4gIWPGRiapHvKcE8UyHQ7nDf4nuibPJRmaDK94XBiaZMfvWNB2fXukHricPFvxEX1OTtiaVNoQustGxBmqc1ib4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWGXjJD0K5vXJ7VLCDBORRvhd3EicurFJbk2HicsWrdJroJn8DOO3hCecV54xKsIHNicNjbdqH1ibuRaP2Owx6Rdx9Um8Gqe1TlZ2tg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWGPucwSRic7gVVnfUPice3htDCt4Mu4AIngDoQCzcazwzU8bFlK4qqp1Bqc235r2tribia5F7aPJhvjueTz5eOZ0kLTwRgFCTM4bH4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWFlbUnagicCmJfobeblpWKf7xNXFHoam908mMxVaSkQxz6ps65zDrzFq0IicsOMJLRribPx7443moiaYziahmqYTEsfNvBYvNusrnUI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWE7nkK8QPvibjgSh41GNCEia8MD8aRKtWxOm6sgclvNOWbL2PpOtzpqI9dqLeWnDiceCc55S7BZwusMBtwVm4J2ZwT4yMTpxibyPGA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWG6Msy4kccQBJMtRqxEpJ9ZJfiaKof9ojicWOBiaDqSKz9FNL4PpcTb1LKBIgUG4jWhZejh8IfLBywjYOecBpU3WvxjBVeCDvLTrk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWGM31kS4n8kJLhVU6B8EMmrxcadbBqEYBcyRanRCamwagq3gdlFt2eV6NRDhLVuoctj1xM1MOaeHF3flb7L9du0ptHGJPXkFsM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWFib5lFspoicgbvBd0TporQJ00yPAS8NjnJYxzmy8umbWsDaEBUt0oSgarm1EFpr18J4pVanZzZg3zorHIM4hXD2lsYC3Gf33ia8o/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWGmnOGOcFIba1NzYN5EibqcziboaTk9hCLEm333HStiaEfcnaqrCfuE5hwV73a9iaJwz4CP5ibKIguJibwyAOTMQ3YBwPRGbY79yMib6w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWH7TSxSMRkolrRELILZlSReDV6DO2Bxt2hibKq9sIbcyLs74xJJDIoJicliaIe22uficxGMxCTjkMPolPC22bIxFrOjm9yP4p1nl1c/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWFnojrCy6LSiaVHZGRd9sAicUYYRBicnpYh6VhUNrnbzvvfUU5ulV9ecZtwYa44Z2qkxbmFH4YmNzRZ6wY9jj5NicYjIWpO2j5baL8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWGhUpvveLmPnJNHGHoKWcibDiabUC0BuRWhvdhz5eZoeBqMiaQlXRPBK07LnuH7dOMQxicxSaXsv9o8Wy9iaibDHvV1OiacuvFiahvVc08/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/KTj61r3bYWFhyFwQd1jgZYl0wObRDux0EQftEwfwgk3DCI3O7aEicTKFwJibLZoTEvdVPChWPwGWZdiatGYhH1uibkAjwqD0F2jHoicslNOxBoKI/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg&watermark=1","htt